---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
import SectionHead from "./SectionHead.astro";
import Panel from "./Panel.astro";

const privacy = "https://github.com/elianiva/meiro#privacy";
---

<Section id="privacy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <SectionHead
      title="Nothing is sent without asking."
      lead="The install count is one message, sent only after you agree. Crash reports are a separate switch, off by default. Both are in Settings, under Privacy."
    />
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))] gap-[clamp(16px,2vw,28px)] max-lg:grid-cols-[1fr]">
      <Panel
        title="The install count"
        text="Meiro asks once, on first run. Send details adds the OS, architecture and Meiro version. Just ping sends only a random ID. No thanks, or closing the notice, sends nothing."
      />
      <Panel
        title="Crash reports"
        text="Off until you turn them on. When Meiro crashes, it sends the version, the system, what the app was doing and the stack trace to Sentry, with secrets and web addresses removed first."
        class="[--d:1]"
      />
    </div>
    <p class="reveal mt-8 max-w-[58ch] text-small text-muted [--d:2]">
      Every message is listed in the <a href={privacy}>privacy section of the repository</a
      >, next to what Meiro keeps on your device and how to remove it. This website counts views
      and download clicks with PostHog, without cookies, profiles or session recordings.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
